                "text": "Every dollar stolen from our healthcare programs is one dollar too many. That's why I introduced the Medicare and Medicaid Fraud Prevention Act.\n\nThis bipartisan bill is a common-sense step toward better protecting your healthcare and ensuring resources are going to those who need it most. Read more here \u2b07\ufe0f\n\nhttps://t.co/1t5Se7jch2",
