                "reply_count": 7,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This week, I proudly voted to pass the FY25 Military Construction and Veterans Affairs Appropriations bill.\n\nSimply put, this bill helps ensure we're meeting our national security needs both at home and abroad. It fully funds our veterans' healthcare and benefits, invests in military family housing, and provides critical funding to the Indo-Pacific.\n\nI'm committed to supporting our veterans, military families, and national defense, and this bill reflects that commitment.",
