                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 18,
                "retweet_count": 12,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I'm proud to support this year's FY25 Military Construction and Veterans Affairs Appropriations bill, which today passed the House.\n\nIt fully funds the healthcare and benefits our veterans deserve, supports military families and quality of life on base, and strengthens America's defense.\n\nI'm committed to fully supporting our veterans and troops who answered the call of duty, and I'm proud to say this bill reflects that commitment. Read more about this critical, bipartisan legislation here \u2b07\ufe0f\n\nhttps://t.co/gL3lIxxjwI",
