                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 13,
                "retweet_count": 22,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Californians deserve accountability. During the pandemic, Sacramento lost billions in taxpayer dollars due to rampant waste, fraud, and abuse of the unemployment insurance system. \n\nProud to stand with @RepSteel in demanding answers on why this historic theft is being swept under the rug by the Biden-Harris administration. We need transparency and responsible leadership to protect taxpayer dollars.",
