                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 11,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "\ud83d\udea8 ATTENTION VETERANS \ud83d\udea8\n\nMy bill is coming to the floor next week to fix a $2.88 billion VA shortfall that could cause vets to lose pensions, burial rights, life insurance, and GI Bill benefits by Sept 20.\n\nYou served your country\u2014you\u2019ve earned these benefits. I\u2019m committed to solving this problem and holding the VA accountable. This isn\u2019t about politics; it\u2019s about ensuring every veteran gets the care they deserve.\n\nWatch below for more details \u2b07\ufe0f",
                "text_lang": "en",
