                "reply_count": 16,
                "retweet_count": 9,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Since day one, I promised I would never vote to cut Social Security, Medicare, or Medicaid\u2014and I\u2019m keeping that promise. \n\nThe House \ud835\udc29\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc1d my Medicare and Medicaid Fraud Prevention Act, ensuring your tax dollars go to the people who need them, not scammers. \n\n@AARP @NTU \n\nhttps://t.co/X03Wv069U7",
