                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Medicare and Medicaid should serve Americans\u2014not scammers. My bill, the Medicare and Medicaid Fraud Prevention Act, just passed the House to ensure these programs stay protected. \n\nWatch my remarks below to see how I\u2019m safeguarding these vital benefits for the long term. https://t.co/OIW2rgjpun",
