                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "With fire season here and insurance costs soaring due to Sacramento\u2019s policies, I\u2019m proud to cosponsor the SAFE HOME Act, offering up to $25,000 in tax credits to help families protect \ntheir homes from wildfire threats. \n\nThis will save lives, protect property, and lower costs for Californians.\n\nhttps://t.co/SujmubfGWG",
