                "text": "I will always stand up for Social Security and Medicare\u2014that\u2019s why I\u2019m fighting for #HR82 to repeal the WEP and GPO.\n\n\u274c No cuts to your benefits\u2014ever.\n\u274c Ending unfair penalties that hurt our retired teachers, firefighters, and first responders.\n\u274c Making sure our public servants get every dollar they\u2019ve earned.\n\nOur heroes deserve better, and I\u2019m fighting to make it right.",
