                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Social Security is a promise\u2014if you\u2019ve paid into it, you deserve what\u2019s yours. \n\nThat\u2019s why I cosponsored the Social Security Fairness Act to restore full benefits for teachers, firefighters, and police officers. And with my Medicare and Medicaid Fraud Prevention Act passing the House, we\u2019re closer to shutting down scammers for good. \n\nI\u2019ll never vote to cut Social Security and Medicare. I\u2019ve fought, and will continue to fight, to protect and expand these programs so seniors receive the benefits they\u2019re owed.",
